Heb 13:1 , Divers admonitions as to charity;
Heb 13:4 , to honest life;
Heb 13:5 , to avoid covetousness;
Heb 13:7 , to regard God's preachers;
Heb 13:9 , to take heed of strange doctrines;
Heb 13:10 , to confess Christ;
Heb 13:16 , to give alms;
Heb 13:17 , to obey governors;
Heb 13:18 , to pray for the apostles;
Heb 13:20 , The conclusion.
